│ 🥉 Bob:     545 points (7/10 correct, best streak: 3)                      │
│ 4. Charlie: 410 points (8/10 correct, best streak: 2)                      │
│ 5. Diana:   285 points (5/10 correct, best streak: 2)                      │
│                                                                             │
