├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                             │
│ Bob (Imposter): Can you guess the REAL word to earn 50 points?             │
│                                                                             │
│ Bob guesses: "PIZZA" ✓                                                     │
│                                                                             │
│ Bob earns 50 bonus points for guessing the real word!                      │
